{
  "$schema": "https://aka.ms/codetour-schema",
  "title": "Testing 01: Unit Testing with Vitest (describe / it / expect) / 単体テストの基礎",
  "tags": [
    "Testing Fundamentals",
    "Vitest",
    "Unit Testing"
